  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE
    value: '<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters in any position triggers Free Games.

      - Free Games contains symbols with multipliers.

      - All multipliers in a single pay line are added and applied to that pay line. '
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE
    value: <style=title><size=45>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FORTUNE
    value: "<size=24>- There are gold reels throughout the spins.\n- Regular reels
      may also randomly transform into gold reels. \n- 3 or more consecutive gold
      reels awards the following:\n     - 3 or more gold reels awards coins.\n     -
      4 or more gold reels triggers God of Wealth Jackpot.\n     - 5 or more gold
      reels awards Reel Jackpot and triggers God of Wealth                                                  \n
      \       Jackpot."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=45>God Of Wealth Jackpot</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FORTUNE
    value: <style=title><size=45>Fortune Reel Feature</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: "<size=24>- Pick among 12 coins until revealing 3 of the same jackpot symbol.
      \n- Mini, Minor, Mega, Grand jackpot may be awarded."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_10
    value: "<size=16>Scatter Pay is multiplied by Total Bet.   \n3 or more Scatters
      triggers \nFree Games Bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
